### Orvexa API v1 — journey step 01: health & discovery
### Part of api/examples/ (issue #47). Run the numbered files in order with the
### VS Code REST Client (ms-vscode.restclient) or JetBrains HTTP client.
###
### Variables: ORVEXA_URL/KEY/SECRET come from the environment — never paste
### real credentials into these files. Export them before sending:
###   export ORVEXA_URL=http://localhost:8080 ORVEXA_KEY=<raw key> ORVEXA_SECRET=<webhook hmac secret>
### Local stack: see docs/devstack.md and the first-tenant bootstrap in
### docs/runbooks/operations.md (organizations/tenants/api_keys SQL).

@ORVEXA_URL = {{$processEnv ORVEXA_URL}}
@ORVEXA_KEY = {{$processEnv ORVEXA_KEY}}

### Liveness (public, always 200 while serving)
# @name liveness
GET {{ORVEXA_URL}}/healthz

###

### Readiness — the journey gate (503 `degraded` when a component is down)
# @name readiness
GET {{ORVEXA_URL}}/readyz

###

### Resource index / discovery (envelope data = {resources[]})
# @name discovery
GET {{ORVEXA_URL}}/api/v1/
X-API-Key: {{ORVEXA_KEY}}

###

### Auth is enforced (401 auth.missing_key without a key — fail-closed)
# @name noKeyRejected
GET {{ORVEXA_URL}}/api/v1/customers
